:0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Context:** better-sqlite3@^12.0.0 transitively depends on `prebuild-install@7.1.3` (via the \"install\" script in package.json).\n\n**Issue:** The `prebuild-install` repository was archived in February 2026. While this is an install-only dependency and not a runtime concern, archived dependencies pose supply-chain hygiene questions.\n\n**Question:** Does the better-sqlite3 project have a planned migration timeline away from the deprecated prebuild-install? If so, which successor (e.g., @prebuild/install, direct napi-rs usage, or another approach) are you evaluating?\n\nHappy to help test or contribute if a migration branch exists.","closed_by":{"login":"JoshuaWise","id":8255757,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNTU3NTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8255757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise","html_url":"https://github.com/JoshuaWise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoshuaWise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WiseLibs/better-sqlite3/issues/1491/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WiseLibs/better-sqlite3/issues/1491/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":n